  "title": "Deduced class template arguments",
  "summary": "A class template whose arguments its initialization deduces shows them",
  "prose": "The arguments follow the template's name wherever it is written without them: a declaration, a functional cast, a `new`. A variable initialized by such a cast shows no type of its own, the arguments already say it.",
  "status": "supported",
